        "thought_text": "Consider using dynamic programming to avoid deep recursion and improve efficiency. Create a 2D DP table where `dp[i][j]` represents the maximum value achievable by performing operations on the subsequence `a[i:j+1]`. This approach will help manage the state transitions and prevent excessive recursion depth.",
