        "node_id": "n_3_7cd967",
        "thought_text": "Consider simulating the process from both ends towards the center, but prioritize choosing the element that leads to the highest possible sum in the next step. This approach ensures that we make locally optimal choices that contribute to a globally optimal solution.",
