        "thought_text": "Revised Thought-2: To correctly fill the DP table, consider both options for choosing an element to delete (either the leftmost or rightmost element) and then add the sum of the remaining elements. For each subsequence `a[i:j+1]`, calculate the maximum value by either deleting the leftmost element (`dp[i+1][j]`) or the rightmost element (`dp[i][j-1]`), and then adding the sum of the remaining elements `A[i] + A[j]`. This ensures that we explore all valid operations and choose the one that maximizes the value for the current subsequence.",
